{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0103_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7a0f9b1ff4ed1ddc12b381803e7a8c75a18a2d5f5ebfce10b4620bebcafc3027", "ja": "（人気ゲームとのコラボ番組『アイドルワイルド\nハンター』の撮影が無事に終わった）", "zh": "（与热门游戏合作的节目\n《偶像狂野猎人》的录影，顺利结束了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0103_1001_009rit", "source_sha256": "c79a602c993adcffd26a276297af7599a42d22362fa613fe0be697ca74a64f17", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れ様です！\nふう、どうでしたか？　私の演技。", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦了！\n呼，我演得如何呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0103_1002_p", "source_sha256": "93bf66b76dd35d464f270b3dfd1abf4ffc1ab9cb950b8c67624d16401ce02977", "ja": "ああ、完璧だったぞ。ウェイトレス兼ハンター役なんて\n難しい役だったけど、さすがだな。", "zh": "嗯，很完美喔，不愧是律子。\n女服务生兼猎人这个角色可不好演啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0103_1003_p", "source_sha256": "14ebbdee2da5a569c1192c40f22f6c63c8456093d0e80abdeb8d1065854b7504", "ja": "しかも、矢を射るシーンでは一発でドラゴンの頭に\n命中させてたし……。監督も感心してたよ。", "zh": "而且在射箭场景还一箭就命中龙的头部……\n连导演都很佩服你呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0103_1004_009rit", "source_sha256": "59a964fa87f922ae6c6eb862abd6a1a4b9e443503067029ebbc853363e96554e", "ja": "まあ、今回の撮影は技術指導も入りましたし、\n私も自主練して、精度の向上に努めましたからね！", "zh": "还好啦，毕竟这次拍戏有技术指导，\n而且我也有自行练习，努力提升准度！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0103_1005_009rit", "source_sha256": "205542d8a20b8820a5f3143e77fba3a99d24eb867e0bd23c25ce02c67f3eb04a", "ja": "弓術関係のお仕事が来たら、また私に任せてください。\nなーんて、ふふっ。めったにないでしょうけど。", "zh": "如果又有弓术相关的工作上门，请再交给我吧。\n开玩笑的啦～呵呵！应该不太会有就是了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0103_1006_p", "source_sha256": "9bf82d58955bd2d59cc11af0732f479f33124b3298bb7c016807dbc25e7e6acd", "ja": "本当か？　よかった。実はさっき、監督から\n次の仕事の依頼があったんだよ。", "zh": "真的吗？太好了。\n其实导演刚才委托了我下一件工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0103_1007_009rit", "source_sha256": "7cc8345f8cdbc8bc544488cfb6941b2c568d3882869c459ad6d974c2c216feb8", "ja": "え、さっそくですか？　あはは、ちょっといいとこ\n見せすぎちゃったかな？　それで、どんな企画です？", "zh": "咦，马上就有吗？哈哈哈，我是不是表现得太棒了？\n那么，是什么样的企划？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0103_1008_p", "source_sha256": "b4eb506e1f02a50ce23588d337f69c276acf92367365af4989eb1c69cb447920", "ja": "ああ、それがな。『激走！　流鏑馬ライブ！』\nっていうネット番組の企画らしい。", "zh": "这个嘛，好像是个叫做《奔驰！流镝马演唱会！》\n的网路节目企划。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0103_1009_009rit", "source_sha256": "1e57906a01e2106b1e17915d9ce7329bf1801561afe7db98ba8a2f7d787da367", "ja": "へえ、いいじゃないですか。私もちょうど、\n流鏑馬の季節だなーなんて思ってたところで……。", "zh": "哦，听起来不错啊。\n我也正好在想，流镝马的季节到了呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0103_1010_009rit", "source_sha256": "84ea757fda596e756700a5f4add9432a9d4b603b67346a361df04da3eef78611", "ja": "って……や、流鏑馬！？　馬に乗りながら矢を射る\nアレですよね？　しかも歌うんですか？　ええ！？", "zh": "呃，等等……流、流镝马！？是一边骑马一边射箭的那个\n对吧？而且还要唱歌吗？咦咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0103_1011_009rit", "source_sha256": "2012cc69de71ff5e6d532d24a96a52e65122a5041079c5d3d16e75aea7513bdb", "ja": "いやいやいや！　いくら弓つながりでも、さすがに\n馬は難易度が高すぎません！？　む、無理ですってば！", "zh": "不不不！就算是跟弓术相关，\n骑马难度也太高了吧！？没、没办法啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0103_1012_p", "source_sha256": "2e75c278b17a8b2abdf28e2edd45beebc7115823a024ab5d1192fae85bf8daa9", "ja": "はは、そうだよな。さっそうと馬を乗りこなす\nアイドルとか、絵になると思ったんだけどな……。", "zh": "哈哈，说得也是。\n虽然我觉得能飒爽骑马的偶像，应该会非常上相……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0103_1013_009rit", "source_sha256": "2f162d1ff3e20b7f5e54a51a51a496796067a3ffa4c03658a4b80ef192d349a8", "ja": "うっ……。", "zh": "呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0103_1014_p", "source_sha256": "51374bd355ee805f7d2c1d693d70dffc623582eb91b1c17982ef7d52c2b81d68", "ja": "ネット番組だから、世界中にファンが増える\nチャンスだと……いや、いいんだ。ごめん……。", "zh": "而且演出网路节目有机会增加来自世界各地的粉丝……\n算了，没关系，不好意思……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0103_1015_009rit", "source_sha256": "03512b73435e2aae94658aef9ce8402907b30f97a17544f6df3b1246f8c20563", "ja": "ううっ……なんですか。そんな悲しそうな顔しても、\n馬なんて無理ですってば……。", "zh": "呜呜……你是怎样啦。\n就算露出那么悲伤的表情，我也是没办法骑马啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0103_1017_009rit", "source_sha256": "3914e63a125f08818c87514271f99df4cb3e7489e0a75c7a3a2eecceec00f26d", "ja": "……あ～、もうっ！\nわかりました、わかりましたよ！", "zh": "……啊～真是的！\n我知道了，我知道了啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0103_1018_009rit", "source_sha256": "c73154c5ceacd2b3488e8c5af2e238e60a750f0dab08b115b9624d10f0763350", "ja": "毒を食らわばなんとやら、\nこうなったらやるだけやってみます！", "zh": "一不做二不休，\n既然如此，我会尽量试试看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0103_1019_p", "source_sha256": "6022d04b6c6fd3fc36372f58ee2144c927391182886f953f738724c7fd4dc6ad", "ja": "ありがとう、律子！\n俺もできる限り、サポートするからな。", "zh": "谢谢你，律子！\n我也会尽我所能协助你的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0103_1020_009rit", "source_sha256": "0246ac1e85408c67c1fb1270d217c353e16f9d18b2ff32719a2f81e3f57cb6c2", "ja": "はいはい。お任せください{$P$}殿。\n馬でもドラゴンでも、乗りこなしてみせますよ。", "zh": "好好好。请交给我吧，{$P$}阁下。\n不论马还是龙，我都会驾驭给你看的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0103_1021_009rit", "source_sha256": "9da91932ee6b058c5e1b460b153d58f90f7e149659bc362b7e7fd950e53cf15b", "ja": "あーでも……。\nできれば、ポニーで手を打ちません？　あはは……。", "zh": "啊～不过……\n可以的话，能不能骑小马就好？哈哈哈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
